  "answer": "Project Zenith is currently in Phase Two, marked by significant progress in predictive analytics and the integration of real-time analytics. The project has secured a strategic partnership with TechInnovate, a leader in AI research, to enhance its goals. The team has expanded with five new members specializing in cybersecurity, cloud architecture, machine learning, and cloud computing. Key milestones include the successful testing of a secure file sharing prototype ahead of schedule. The project budget has been adjusted to $550,000 to accommodate unforeseen expenses. The team is currently gathering innovative ideas for data visualization tools and seeking stakeholder feedback on the prototype's performance and user experience, with a detailed report and onboarding sessions scheduled for late 2023."
